🌱 GreenSpace AI

Your Space. Your Climate. Your Garden.

GreenSpace AI is an AI-powered, climate-smart gardening assistant designed to help people grow suitable plants based on their geographical location, local weather conditions, available gardening space and personal lifestyle.

🎯 Project Objective

To make gardening easier, smarter and more sustainable through the integration of Artificial Intelligence, GIS, meteorological data and plant science.

✨ Planned Features

- 🌦️ Climate Intelligence: Analyse local temperature, rainfall, humidity and seasonal conditions.
- 📍 Location-Based Recommendations: Suggest plants suitable for the user's geographical location.
- 📸 AI Garden Space Analysis: Analyse uploaded photographs of available gardening spaces.
- 🌿 Smart Plant Recommendations: Recommend suitable vegetables, fruits, herbs and flowering plants.
- 💧 Watering Assistant: Provide personalised watering schedules.
- 🧪 Fertilizer Calculator: Estimate fertilizer requirements based on plant growth stage and soil conditions.
- 🦠 AI Plant Doctor: Identify possible plant diseases and pest damage from photographs.
- 📊 Plant Growth Tracker: Monitor plant growth through periodic photographs.
- 📅 Smart Gardening Planner: Create daily and weekly maintenance schedules.
- 💰 Gardening Budget Calculator: Estimate gardening setup and maintenance expenses.
- 🗣️ Multilingual Assistant: Support regional languages including Tamil and English.

