📍 Initial Development Region

Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu, India.

The initial prototype will focus on understanding local climatic conditions and recommending suitable plants for home gardening.

🚀 Development Roadmap

1. Python programming foundation.
2. Weather API integration.
3. Plant database development.
4. Climate-based plant recommendation engine.
5. Garden space image analysis.
6. Personalised plant maintenance system.
7. GIS and remote sensing integration.
8. Testing and deployment.

🌍 Vision

To develop an intelligent gardening ecosystem that connects people, plants and the environment through technology.

Don't change your environment to grow a plant. Find the right plant for your environment.

